SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_TylerExplanation::
    .string "Hey, Samuel! Heading out to train\n"
    .string "your POKéMON?\p"
    .string "Did you know that Technical Machines\n"
    .string "can't be used directly from your Bag?\p"
    .string "If you want to teach your POKéMON\n"
    .string "new moves, you'll need to seek out\l"
    .string "Dojo Move Tutors across Kanto!\p"
    .string "Also, check your Journal in the\n"
    .string "START menu under POKéDEX to keep\l"
    .string "track of your active research!$"

SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_AnnExplanation::
    .string "Did you know that every POKéMON has\n"
    .string "its own unique height and weight?\p"
    .string "You can check individual dimensions\n"
    .string "and percentiles on the Trainer Memo!\p"
    .string "Weight makes a huge difference in battle:\n"
    .string "heavier POKéMON hit harder with physical\l"
    .string "moves, while lighter ones move faster!\p"
    .string "Your POKéDEX will even keep track of\n"
    .string "record sizes for every species you catch!$"

SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_CruisingAroundWorld::
    .string "We are cruising around the world,\n"
    .string "my children and I.$"

